## Desktop client

The independent Tauri application is in `client/`.

```sh
bun install --cwd client
bun run --cwd client check
bun test --cwd client
bun run --cwd client build
bun run --cwd client tauri build
```

The final command requires the platform-specific prerequisites documented by
Tauri and emits desktop bundles below `client/src-tauri/target/release/bundle/`.
{% if client_playwright %}
Install Chromium with `bunx --cwd client playwright install chromium`, then run
`bun run --cwd client test:e2e`.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if 'frontend' in components and frontend_variant == 'astro' %}
## Astro frontend

The independent Astro site is in `frontend/`.

```sh
bun install --cwd frontend
bun run --cwd frontend dev
bun run --cwd frontend check
bun run --cwd frontend build
```

The production artifact is the provider-neutral `frontend/dist/` directory.
{% if frontend_playwright %}
Install a Playwright browser with `bunx --cwd frontend playwright install chromium`,
then run the end-to-end suite with `bun run --cwd frontend test:e2e`.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

